1
00:00:00,896 --> 00:00:02,066
(nervous chuckle)

2
00:00:02,064 --> 00:00:03,264
(Howard:)Like off the map.

3
00:00:03,265 --> 00:00:05,695
Like every American Idol winner
since season four.

4
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:10,170
(Bernadette:)Come on, Howard,
you're overreacting.

5
00:00:10,172 --> 00:00:11,942
(Howard:)Am I?

6
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:15,141
(whispers):
Am I?

7
00:00:15,144 --> 00:00:17,814
Wha... what do you want to bet
some black ops guy

8
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:19,813
(Howard:)is reprinting
my high school yearbook

9
00:00:19,815 --> 00:00:22,545
(Howard:)and I'm no longer in it?

10
00:00:22,551 --> 00:00:24,751
(Howard:)That chess club picture is now

11
00:00:24,754 --> 00:00:26,624
(Howard:)just David Zimmerman
and Elaine Cho.

12
00:00:26,622 --> 00:00:30,562
(Raj:)Okay, look,
I'm on the Air Force Web site,

13
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,689
(Raj:)and the department
that e-mailed you

14
00:00:31,694 --> 00:00:32,794
(Raj:)is in charge of acquisitions.

15
00:00:32,795 --> 00:00:34,395
(Raj:)So maybe they just
want to give you

16
00:00:34,397 --> 00:00:35,897
(Raj:)a lot of money
for your invention.

17
00:00:35,898 --> 00:00:38,328
(Howard:)Oh, please, that's
not how it works.

18
00:00:38,334 --> 00:00:40,934
You saw E.T., Avatar,
Jurassic World.

19
00:00:40,936 --> 00:00:45,236
(Howard:)The military just shows up
and takes over.

20
00:00:45,241 --> 00:00:48,011
(Bernadette:)You do realize those weren't
documentaries, right?

21
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:50,480
(chuckles)

22
00:00:50,479 --> 00:00:52,209
(Howard:)I'm sorry, you find this funny?

23
00:00:52,214 --> 00:00:54,784
(Raj:)No, I was just thinking
about Jurassic World.

24
00:00:54,784 --> 00:01:06,024
(Raj:)Boy, that was terrible.

